{
 "lessonId": "lesson-04-box-model",
 "allow": [
  "html",
  "css"
 ],
 "topic": {
  "ru": "Box model",
  "uz": "Box model",
  "en": "Box model"
 },
 "sections": {
  "1": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "Padding и border",
    "uz": "Padding va border",
    "en": "Padding and border"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Сделаем карточке внутренний отступ и рамку.",
    "uz": "Kartochkaga ichki chekinish va ramka qilamiz.",
    "en": "Let's give the card padding and a border."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Мой сайт</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>Кроссовки</h3>\n    <p>450 000 сум</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": ".card {\n  width: 250px;\n  background: #f4f4f4;\n}\n"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "style.css",
     "re": "\\.card\\s*\\{[^}]*padding\\s*:\\s*\\d+px",
     "say": {
      "ru": "Добавь `.card` внутренний отступ: `padding: 20px;`",
      "uz": "`.card` ga ichki chekinish qo'sh: `padding: 20px;`",
      "en": "Add padding to `.card`: `padding: 20px;`"
     },
     "show": "padding: 20px;"
    },
    {
     "file": "style.css",
     "re": "\\.card\\s*\\{[^}]*border\\s*:\\s*\\d+px\\s+(solid|dashed|dotted)",
     "say": {
      "ru": "И рамку: `border: 2px solid black;`",
      "uz": "Va ramka: `border: 2px solid black;`",
      "en": "And a border: `border: 2px solid black;`"
     },
     "show": "border: 2px solid black;"
    }
   ],
   "open": "style.css"
  },
  "4": {
   "title": {
    "ru": "box-sizing",
    "uz": "box-sizing",
    "en": "box-sizing"
   },
   "intro": {
    "ru": "Включим главное правило — border-box.",
    "uz": "Asosiy qoidani yoqamiz — border-box.",
    "en": "Let's turn on the main rule — border-box."
   },
   "files": {
    "index.html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <title>Мой сайт</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h3>Кроссовки</h3>\n    <p>450 000 сум</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
    "style.css": ".card {\n  width: 250px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  border: 2px solid black;\n}\n"
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "file": "style.css",
     "re": "\\*\\s*\\{[^}]*box-sizing\\s*:\\s*border-box",
     "say": {
      "ru": "В самом начале CSS: `* { box-sizing: border-box; }`",
      "uz": "CSS ning boshida: `* { box-sizing: border-box; }`",
      "en": "At the very top of CSS: `* { box-sizing: border-box; }`"
     },
     "show": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}"
    },
    {
     "file": "style.css",
     "re": "\\.card\\s*\\{[^}]*margin\\s*:\\s*\\d+px",
     "say": {
      "ru": "И отступ снаружи карточки: `margin: 20px;`",
      "uz": "Va kartochka tashqarisidan chekinish: `margin: 20px;`",
      "en": "And space outside the card: `margin: 20px;`"
     },
     "show": "margin: 20px;"
    }
   ],
   "open": "style.css"
  }
 },
 "homework": {
